{"route":"/docs/4.2/about/team/","version":"4.2","renderedVersion":"4.2","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Team","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"An overview of the founding team and core contributors to Bootstrap."},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap is maintained by the founding team and a small group of invaluable core contributors, with the massive support and involvement of our community."},{"id":"content--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/mdo\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"@mdo\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Mark Otto</strong> @mdo</a>\n\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fat\"><img src=\"https://github.com/fat.png\" alt=\"@fat\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Jacob Thornton</strong> @fat</a>\n\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/cvrebert\"><img src=\"https://github.com/cvrebert.png\" alt=\"@cvrebert\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Chris Rebert</strong> @cvrebert</a>\n\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/xhmikosr\"><img src=\"https://github.com/xhmikosr.png\" alt=\"@xhmikosr\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>XhmikosR</strong> @xhmikosr</a>\n\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/patrickhlauke\"><img src=\"https://github.com/patrickhlauke.png\" alt=\"@patrickhlauke\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Patrick H. Lauke</strong> @patrickhlauke</a>\n\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/glebm\"><img src=\"https://github.com/glebm.png\" alt=\"@glebm\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Gleb Mazovetskiy</strong> @glebm</a>\n\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/johann-s\"><img src=\"https://github.com/johann-s.png\" alt=\"@johann-s\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Johann-S</strong> @johann-s</a>\n\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/andresgalante\"><img src=\"https://github.com/andresgalante.png\" alt=\"@andresgalante\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Andres Galante</strong> @andresgalante</a>\n\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/martij